Ravana begs Maricha as supreme refuge in distress --- Ravana reports Janasthana kin Khara Dushana Trishiras slain --- Ravana reports lone footman Rama slew fourteen thousand --- Ravana vilifies Rama as cruel greedy lawless exile foe --- Ravana charges sister disfigured ear-nose without cause --- Ravana demands golden deer lure before Sita --- Ravana plans abducting lone Sita like Rahu moon --- Ravana plans striking wife-bereft Rama at ease --- Maricha dries-mouthed terrified folds hands for reply